title: "Two-way leakage audit and abstention diagnostics for code vulnerability benchmarks (ESWA submission)"
abstract: "Code and result records for a controlled study showing that a group split built from detected near-duplicate clusters can report zero detector overlap while leaving substantial true-family overlap, with dose-response estimation and abstention diagnostics."
